{"config": "B-hybrid-rerank-gptoss20b", "qid": "A04", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC must report the digital lending apps it uses on the Centralised Information Management System (CIMS) portal of the Reserve Bank.", "citations": ["D16_B_0026"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0001938, "gen_latency_s": 1.2217572000008659, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2460, "output_tokens": 95, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0001938, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0026", "D16_B_0027", "D16_B_0020", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0025"], "retrieval_latency_s": 7.477289300004486, "total_latency_s": 8.699185500001477, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-rerank-gptoss20b", "qid": "A05", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "When an LSP works with multiple lenders, it must provide the borrower with a digital view of all loan offers that match the borrower’s request, including the names of the lenders, the amount and tenor, APR, monthly repayment obligation and penal charges (if applicable), and a link to each lender’s KFS, in a way that enables fair comparison. The digital view must also disclose lenders whose offers do not match the borrower’s request.", "citations": ["D16_B_0013"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000224025, "gen_latency_s": 1.2751152999990154, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2583, "output_tokens": 165, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000224025, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0013", "D16_B_0049", "D16_B_0017", "D16_B_0061", "D16_B_0033"], "retrieval_latency_s": 9.362700300000142, "total_latency_s": 10.637971299998753, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
