{"config": "B-hybrid-rerank-gptoss20b", "qid": "A07", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No – a lending app (NBFC) must not access a borrower’s contact list, photos, or other file and media resources on the phone.  Only a one‑time access for camera, microphone, location or other facilities needed for onboarding/KYC is allowed with explicit consent.\n", "citations": ["D16_B_0021"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00021157499999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.0751257999945665, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2405, "output_tokens": 168, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000211575, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0026", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0020"], "retrieval_latency_s": 8.86167050000222, "total_latency_s": 9.93691700000636, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-rerank-gptoss20b", "qid": "A08", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "If a borrower does not receive any reply from the NBFC or its LSP within 30 days of lodging a complaint, the borrower may lodge a complaint with the Reserve Bank‑Integrated Ombudsman Scheme via the Complaint Management System (CMS) portal (https://cms.rbi.org.in/) or send a physical complaint to the Centralised Receipt and Processing Centre, 4th Floor, Reserve Bank of India, Sector –17, Central Vista, Chandigarh – 160017.", "citations": ["D16_B_0020"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000250125, "gen_latency_s": 1.165816699998686, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2543, "output_tokens": 198, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000250125, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0020", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0017", "D16_B_0026", "D16_B_0016"], "retrieval_latency_s": 8.001999500003876, "total_latency_s": 9.167931399999361, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
